msgctxt "64"
msgid ""
"What a mess. Cops are crawling all out front the Millennium\r\n"
"Tower... but I think I got a way around 'em."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid ""
"It's kinda a pain, but head east toward <Color:7>Nakamichi Street<Color:Default>,\r\n"
"cut across down by the Club Sega, then keep going 'til you\r\n"
"hit <Color:7>Pink Street<Color:Default>. Take that up and around and you'll be good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "660"
msgid "Yuya"
msgstr ""
